<div id="hs_cos_wrapper_module_16980666021538" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" style="" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module">





<section class="page-title-content-block flex flex__col relative flex__align--left theme-color__black text-align-left  ">



      <h2 class="animate-in animate-in--typewriter module-content-wrapper--medium-width is-visible" style="transition-delay: 0s;">
        Your competitive edge with ICEYE
      </h2>



    <p class="module-content-wrapper--small-width no-margin">
      ICEYE’s large constellation of NewSpace satellites provides access to an entirely new level of persistent monitoring for any location on Earth – uninterrupted visibility, day and night, in any weather conditions, enabling a transformative capability for the P&amp;C insurance industry.
    </p>




</section></div>

