<div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-5 dnd-row">
<div class="row-fluid ">
<div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" style="" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" data-w="12">
<div id="hs_cos_wrapper_module_1698066602154" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" style="" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module">
  <section class="icon-text-card">


      <div class="flex flex__wrap flex-gap-row-col desktop-row-offset">








      <div class="span6 text-align-left mobile-col-offset">



              <div class="flex flex__justify--start">
                <div class="icon-background flex flex__center content-margin-bottom-small">
                  <img src="/assets-f/img/95e0ff7045a8b4.svg" class="icon-svg" alt="multiple_satellite" width="91" height="91" loading="lazy">
                </div>
              </div>





          <h3 class="sub-heading">
            Fully dedicated constellation
          </h3>


          <p class="no-margin">
            At the core of our data is ICEYE’s advanced Synthetic Aperture Radar (SAR) technology, powered by the world's largest SAR satellite constellation.
          </p>



      </div>







      <div class="span6 text-align-left mobile-col-offset">



              <div class="flex flex__justify--start">
                <div class="icon-background flex flex__center content-margin-bottom-small">
                  <img src="/assets-f/img/f69d800d39c178.svg" class="icon-svg" alt="satellite_clouds" width="91" height="91" loading="lazy">
                </div>
              </div>





          <h3 class="sub-heading">
            Reliable data source
          </h3>


          <p class="no-margin">
            Unlike optical sensors, our SAR technology operates around the clock, capturing high-resolution imagery day or night, in any weather conditions, and even through smoke and ash. This ensures reliable, timely insights when insurers need them most.
          </p>



      </div>







      <div class="span6 text-align-left mobile-col-offset">



              <div class="flex flex__justify--start">
                <div class="icon-background flex flex__center content-margin-bottom-small">
                  <img src="/assets-f/img/e64e07bd7d890e.svg" class="icon-svg" alt="layers" width="91" height="91" loading="lazy">
                </div>
              </div>





          <h3 class="sub-heading">
            Large-scale event coverage
          </h3>


          <p class="no-margin">
            With multiple imaging modes and a highly agile constellation, we provide rapid coverage of large-scale events with frequent visit rates, enabling insurers to track disaster progression in near real-time.
          </p>



      </div>







      <div class="span6 text-align-left mobile-col-offset">



              <div class="flex flex__justify--start">
                <div class="icon-background flex flex__center content-margin-bottom-small">
                  <img src="/assets-f/img/fd0ccb6e6620b4.svg" class="icon-svg" alt="document_warning" width="91" height="91" loading="lazy">
                </div>
              </div>





          <h3 class="sub-heading">
            Leading insurance industry expertise
          </h3>


          <p class="no-margin">
            Our product roadmap is driven by the unique needs of the P&amp;C insurance ecosystem. Our dedicated teams are led by experts from insurance, reinsurance, meteorology, hydrology, and GIS domains.
          </p>



      </div>


      </div>

